  "id": "penne-with-gorgonzola-pear-and-walnuts",
  "name": "Penne with Gorgonzola, Pear, and Walnuts",
  "subtitle": "Creamy blue-cheese pasta with pear and toasted walnuts",
  "description": "Penne tossed in a buttery Gorgonzola-Parmesan cream sauce with sweet pear and crunchy toasted walnuts.",
